<title>USA: WPI Group names John Powers CFO.</title>
<headline>WPI Group names John Powers CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, N.H. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>WPI Group Inc said on Thursday that it named John Powers vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Powers was most recently chief financial officer for Janco Cos of Dover, N.H., WPI said.</p>
<p>Charles Johnson was the WPI's previous chief financial officer, WPI said.</p>
